        {
          "question": "e-4378",
          "field": null,
          "attribute": "question/worked-solution",
          "value": "Performing the operations on each corresponding entry, we get:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}A-(B-C) & =[\\begin{aligned}-1 & 0 \\\\ 2 & -2\\end{aligned}]-([\\begin{aligned}-1 & -1 \\\\ 2 & 0\\end{aligned}]-[\\begin{aligned}0 & -5 \\\\ 1 & 1\\end{aligned}]) \\\\  & =[\\begin{aligned}-1 & 0 \\\\ 2 & -2\\end{aligned}]-[\\begin{aligned}-1-0 & -1-(-5) \\\\ 2-1 & 0-1\\end{aligned}] \\\\  & =[\\begin{aligned}-1 & 0 \\\\ 2 & -2\\end{aligned}]-[\\begin{aligned}-1 & 4 \\\\ 1 & -1\\end{aligned}] \\\\  & =[\\begin{aligned}-1-(-1) & 0-4 \\\\ 2-1 & -2-(-1)\\end{aligned}] \\\\  & =[\\begin{aligned}0 & -4 \\\\ 1 & -1\\end{aligned}]\\end{aligned}\n$$",
